OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a dry start but
OL,6,Fcloud will soon thicken with outbreaks
OL,7,Fof rain spreading northeast during the
OL,8,Fmorning. Rain will turn heavy at times
OL,9,Fin the afternoon accompanied by
OL,10,Ffreshening southeasterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain quickly clears away
OL,13,Fnortheast, then drier for a time in
OL,14,Fthe evening before further outbreaks
OL,15,Fof heavy rain arrive. Windy everywhere
OL,16,Fwith southerly gales along the Angus
OL,17,Fcoast.
OL,18,
OL,19,CTuesday:FA rather cloudy day with
OL,20,Ffrequent showers, some heavy. A very
OL,21,Fwindy day too with southwesterly gales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
