OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells and scattered showers on
OL,7,FWednesday then mainly dry and bright
OL,8,Fon Thursday and Friday. Feeling mild,
OL,9,Fbut breezy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
